  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mitigating the impact of the withdrawal of EU funding on the UK NGO sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide DFID with the assurance that UK based charities who work internationally, also known as INGOs, International Non Governmental Organisation, are as prepared as they can be for Brexit and the loss of EU funding to their charity. The project will be a short but intensive research based piece of work. Another aim of this project will be to improve the readiness of individual INGOs for Brexit and the loss of EU funding as it addresses any gaps the research identifies in its own state of readiness. The research will be conducted by Humentum, a sector leader in finances and organisational development, who understands the sector very well and enjoys the credibility of the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
